<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0749_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">\n\n\n\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is physically\npounded with a long\ntail or a foreleg,\netc.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith a sharp chop.\nIt has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slapped\nrepeatedly, back\nand forth, two to\nfive times in a row.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit with\na flurry of punches\nthat strike two to\nfive times in a row.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slugged\nby a punch thrown\nwith muscle-packed\npower.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Numerous coins are\nhurled at the foe to\ninflict damage.\nMoney is earned\nafter battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is punched\nwith a fiery fist.\nIt may leave the\ntarget with a burn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is punched\nwith an icy fist.\nIt may leave the\ntarget frozen.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is punched\nwith an electrified\nfist. It may leave\nthe target with\nparalysis.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Hard, pointed, and\nsharp claws rake the\nfoe to inflict damage.\n\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huge, impressive\npincers grip and\nsqueeze the foe.\n\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A vicious, tearing\nattack with pincers.\nThe foe will faint\ninstantly if this\nattack hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A two-turn attack.\nBlades of wind hit the\nfoe on the second\nturn. It has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A frenetic dance to\nuplift the fighting\nspirit. It sharply\nraises the user’s\nAttack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is cut with a\nscythe or a claw.\nIt can also be used\nto cut down thin\ntrees.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A gust of wind is\nwhipped up by wings\nand launched at the\nfoe to inflict damage.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is struck\nwith large, imposing\nwings spread wide\nto inflict damage.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is blown away,\nto be replaced by\nanother Pokémon\nin its party. In the\nwild, the battle ends.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user soars, then\nstrikes on the second\nturn. It can also be\nused for flying to\nany familiar town.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A long body or\ntentacles are used\nto bind and squeeze\nthe foe for two to\nfive turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slammed\nwith a long tail,\nvines, etc., to inflict\ndamage.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is struck\nwith slender, whiplike\nvines to inflict\ndamage.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is stomped\nwith a big foot.\nIt may also make the\ntarget flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is quickly\nkicked twice in\nsuccession using both\nfeet.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nby a kick launched\nwith muscle-packed\npower.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user jumps up\nhigh, then strikes\nwith a kick. If the\nkick misses, the\nuser hurts itself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lashes \nout with a quick,\nspinning kick. It\nmay also make the\ntarget flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sand is hurled in the\nfoe’s face, reducing\nits accuracy.\n\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with\nits head. It may make\nthe foe flinch. To find\nPokémon, hit trees.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is jabbed\nwith a sharply\npointed horn to\ninflict damage.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is jabbed\nrepeatedly with a\nhorn or beak two to\nfive times in a row.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is stabbed\nwith a horn rotating\nlike a drill.\nThe foe instantly\nfaints if it hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A physical attack\nin which the user\ncharges and slams\ninto the foe with\nits whole body.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user drops onto\nthe foe with its full\nbody weight.\nIt may leave the foe\nparalyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A long body or vines\nare used to wrap and\nsqueeze the foe for\ntwo to five turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A reckless, full-body\ncharge attack for\nslamming into the foe.\nIt also damages the\nuser a little.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rampages\nand attacks for two\nto three turns.\nIt then becomes\nconfused, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A reckless, life-\nrisking tackle.\nIt also damages the\nuser by a fairly large\namount, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user wags its tail\ncutely, making the\nfoe less wary.\nThe target’s Defense\nstat is lowered.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is stabbed\nwith a poisonous\nbarb of some sort.\nIt may also poison\nthe target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is stabbed\ntwice by a pair of\nstingers.\nIt may also poison\nthe target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sharp pins are shot\nat the foe in rapid\nsuccession.\nThey hit two to five\ntimes in a row.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is given an\nintimidating leer with\nsharp eyes.\nThe target’s Defense\nstat is reduced.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is bitten with\nviciously sharp fangs.\nIt may make the\ntarget flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user growls in an\nendearing way, making\nthe foe less wary.\nThe target’s Attack\nstat is lowered.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is scared off,\nto be replaced by\nanother Pokémon in\nits party. In the\nwild, the battle ends.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A soothing lullaby is\nsung in a calming\nvoice that puts the\nfoe into a deep\nslumber.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user generates\nodd sound waves from\nits body.\nIt may confuse the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit with a\ndestructive shock\nwave that always\ninflicts 20 HP damage.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">For several turns,\nthis move prevents\nthe foe from using\nthe move it last\nused.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith a spray of harsh\nacid. It may also\nlower the target’s\nSp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith small flames.\nThe target may also\nbe left with a burn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00053" index="53">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is scorched\nwith an intense blast\nof fire. The target\nmay also be left with\na burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00054" index="54">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user cloaks its\nbody with a white mist\nthat prevents any of\nits stats from being\ncut for five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00055" index="55">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is blasted\nwith a forceful shot\nof water.\n\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00056" index="56">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is blasted by\na huge volume of\nwater launched under\ngreat pressure.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00057" index="57">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It swamps the entire\nbattlefield with a\ngiant wave.\nIt can also be used\nfor crossing water.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00058" index="58">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is struck\nwith an icy-cold\nbeam of energy.\nIt may also freeze\nthe target solid.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00059" index="59">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A howling blizzard is\nsummoned to strike\nthe foe.\nIt may also freeze\nthe target solid.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00060" index="60">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith a peculiar ray.\nIt may also leave the\ntarget confused.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00061" index="61">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A spray of bubbles is\nforcefully ejected\nat the foe.\nIt may also lower the\ntarget’s Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00062" index="62">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit with a\nrainbow-colored beam.\nIt may also lower the\ntarget’s Attack\nstat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00063" index="63">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith a powerful beam.\nThe user must rest\non the next turn to\nregain its energy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00064" index="64">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is jabbed\nwith a sharply\npointed beak or\nhorn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00065" index="65">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A corkscrewing\nattack with the\nsharp beak acting\nas a drill.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00066" index="66">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user grabs the\nfoe and recklessly\ndives for the ground.\nIt also hurts the\nuser slightly.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00067" index="67">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A powerful low kick\nthat makes the foe\nfall over. It inflicts\ngreater damage on\nheavier foes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00068" index="68">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A retaliation move\nthat counters any\nphysical attack,\ninflicting double the\ndamage taken.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00069" index="69">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is thrown\nusing the power of\ngravity. It inflicts\ndamage equal to\nthe user’s level.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00070" index="70">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slugged\nwith a punch thrown\nat maximum power.\nIt can also be used\nto move boulders.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00071" index="71">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A nutrient-draining\nattack. The user’s\nHP is restored by\nhalf the damage taken\nby the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00072" index="72">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A nutrient-draining\nattack. The user’s\nHP is restored by\nhalf the damage taken\nby the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00073" index="73">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A seed is planted on\nthe foe. It steals\nsome HP from the foe\nto heal the user on\nevery turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00074" index="74">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user’s body is\nforced to grow all at\nonce. It raises the\nSp. Atk stat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00075" index="75">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sharp-edged leaves\nare launched to slash\nat the foe. It has a\nhigh critical-hit\nratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00076" index="76">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A two-turn attack.\nThe user gathers\nlight, then blasts a\nbundled beam on the\nsecond turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00077" index="77">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cloud of poisonous\ndust is scattered on\nthe foe.\nIt may poison the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00078" index="78">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user scatters a\ncloud of paralyzing\npowder.\nIt may paralyze the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00079" index="79">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user scatters a\nbig cloud of sleep-\ninducing dust around\nthe foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00080" index="80">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by\nscattering petals for\ntwo to three turns.\nThe user then\nbecomes confused.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00081" index="81">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is bound with\nsilk blown from the\nuser’s mouth.\nIt reduces the\ntarget’s Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00082" index="82">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is stricken\nby a shock wave.\nThis attack always\ninflicts 40 HP\ndamage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00083" index="83">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe becomes\ntrapped within a\nfierce vortex of fire\nthat rages for two\nto five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00084" index="84">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A jolt of electricity\nis hurled at the foe\nto inflict damage.\nIt may also leave the\nfoe paralyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00085" index="85">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A strong electric\nblast is loosed at\nthe foe.\nIt may also leave the\nfoe paralyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00086" index="86">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A weak electric\ncharge is launched at\nthe foe.\nIt causes paralysis if\nit hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00087" index="87">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wicked thunderbolt\nis dropped on the foe\nto inflict damage.\nIt may also leave the\ntarget paralyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00088" index="88">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user picks up\nand throws a small\nrock at the foe to\nattack.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00089" index="89">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user sets off an\nearthquake that hits\nall the Pokémon in\nthe battle.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00090" index="90">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user opens up a\nfissure in the ground\nand drops the foe in.\nThe target instantly\nfaints if it hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00091" index="91">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user burrows,\nthen attacks on the\nsecond turn.\nIt can also be used\nto exit dungeons.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00092" index="92">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A move that leaves\nthe target badly\npoisoned.\nIts poison damage\nworsens every turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00093" index="93">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit by a\nweak telekinetic\nforce. It may also\nleave the foe\nconfused.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00094" index="94">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit by a\nstrong telekinetic\nforce. It may also\nreduce the foe’s\nSp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00095" index="95">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user employs\nhypnotic suggestion\nto make the target\nfall into a deep\nsleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00096" index="96">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user meditates\nto awaken the power\ndeep within its body\nand raise its Attack\nstat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00097" index="97">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user relaxes and\nlightens its body to\nmove faster.\nIt sharply boosts\nthe Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00098" index="98">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lunges at\nthe foe at a speed\nthat makes it almost\ninvisible. It is sure\nto strike first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00099" index="99">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">While this move is in\nuse, it gains attack\npower each time the\nuser is hit in battle.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00100" index="100">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Use it to flee from\nany wild Pokémon.\nIt can also warp to\nthe last Pokémon\nCenter visited.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00101" index="101">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user makes the\nfoe see a mirage.\nIt inflicts damage\nmatching the user’s\nlevel.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00102" index="102">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user copies the\nmove last used by\nthe foe. The move can\nbe used for the rest\nof the battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00103" index="103">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An earsplitting\nscreech is emitted to\nsharply reduce the\nfoe’s Defense stat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00104" index="104">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By moving rapidly, the\nuser makes illusory\ncopies of itself to\nraise its evasiveness.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00105" index="105">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A self-healing move.\nThe user restores its\nown HP by up to half\nof its max HP.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00106" index="106">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stiffens all\nthe muscles in its\nbody to raise its\nDefense stat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00107" index="107">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user compresses\nits body to make\nitself look smaller.\nThe user’s evasion\nstat is boosted.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00108" index="108">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user releases an\nobscuring cloud of\nsmoke or ink.\nIt reduces the foe’s\naccuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00109" index="109">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is exposed\nto a sinister ray\nthat triggers\nconfusion.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00110" index="110">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user withdraws\nits body into its hard\nshell, raising its\nDefense stat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00111" index="111">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user curls up to\nconceal weak spots\nand raise its Defense\nstat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00112" index="112">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user throws up a\nsturdy wall that\nsharply raises its\nDefense stat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00113" index="113">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wondrous wall of\nlight is put up to\nsuppress damage from\nspecial attacks for\nfive turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00114" index="114">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates a\nhaze that eliminates\nevery stat change\namong all the Pokémon\nengaged in battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00115" index="115">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A wondrous wall of\nlight is put up to\nsuppress damage from\nphysical attacks for\nfive turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00116" index="116">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user takes a\ndeep breath and\nfocuses to raise the\ncritical-hit ratio of\nits attacks.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00117" index="117">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user endures\nattacks for two\nturns, then strikes\nback to cause double\nthe damage taken.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00118" index="118">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user waggles a\nfinger and stimulates\nthe brain into\nrandomly using nearly\nany move.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00119" index="119">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user counters\nthe foe by mimicking\nthe move last used\nby the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00120" index="120">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user blows up to\ninflict damage on all\nPokémon in battle.\nThe user faints upon\nusing this move.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00121" index="121">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A large egg is hurled\nwith maximum force at\nthe foe to inflict\ndamage.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00122" index="122">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is licked with\na long tongue, causing\ndamage.\nIt may also paralyze\nthe target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00123" index="123">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith a discharge of\nfilthy gases.\nIt may also poison\nthe target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00124" index="124">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Unsanitary sludge is\nhurled at the foe.\nIt may also poison\nthe target.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00125" index="125">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user clubs the\nfoe with a bone.\nIt may also make the\ntarget flinch.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00126" index="126">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith an intense blast\nof all-consuming fire.\nIt may also leave the\ntarget with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00127" index="127">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user charges at\nthe foe rapidly, and\nmay make it flinch.\nIt can also be used\nto climb a waterfall.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00128" index="128">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is clamped\nand squeezed by\nthe user’s very thick\nand sturdy shell for\ntwo to five turns.</language>
