	<row id="msg_0749_00129" index="129">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Star-shaped rays are\nshot at the foe.\nThis attack never\nmisses.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00130" index="130">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tucks in its\nhead to raise its\nDefense in the first\nturn, then rams the\nfoe on the next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00131" index="131">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sharp spikes are\nfired at the foe to\nstrike two to five\ntimes in rapid\nsuccession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00132" index="132">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith long, creeping\ntentacles or vines.\nIt may also lower the\ntarget’s Speed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00133" index="133">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user temporarily\nempties its mind to\nforget its concerns.\nIt sharply raises the\nuser’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00134" index="134">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user distracts\nthe foe by bending a\nspoon.\nIt may lower the\ntarget’s accuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00135" index="135">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user restores its\nown HP by up to half\nof its maximum HP.\nIt may also be used\nto heal an ally’s HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00136" index="136">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith a knee kick from\na jump. If it misses,\nthe user is hurt\ninstead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00137" index="137">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user intimidates\nthe foe with the\npattern on its belly\nto cause paralysis.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00138" index="138">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack that works\nonly on a sleeping\nfoe. It absorbs half\nthe damage caused to\nheal the user’s HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00139" index="139">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A cloud of poison gas\nis sprayed in the\nfoe’s face.\nIt may poison the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00140" index="140">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Round objects are\nhurled at the foe to\nstrike two to five\ntimes in a row.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00141" index="141">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A blood-draining\nattack. The user’s\nHP is restored by\nhalf the damage taken\nby the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00142" index="142">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">With a scary face, the\nuser tries to force a\nkiss on the foe. If it\nsucceeds, the target\nfalls asleep.</language>
