	<row id="msg_0749_00172" index="172">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user cloaks\nitself in fire and\ncharges at the foe.\nIt may also leave the\ntarget with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00173" index="173">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack that can\nbe used only if the\nuser is asleep. The\nharsh noise may also\nmake the foe flinch.</language>
	</row>
