	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00175" index="175">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user flails about\naimlessly to attack.\nIt becomes more\npowerful the less HP\nthe user has.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00176" index="176">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user changes its\ntype to make itself\nresistant to the type\nof the attack it\nlast took.</language>
	</row>
