		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A vortex of air is\nshot at the foe to\ninflict damage.\nIt has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00178" index="178">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user releases\ncottonlike spores\nthat cling to the\nfoe, sharply reducing\nits Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00179" index="179">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An all-out attack\nthat becomes more\npowerful the less\nHP the user has.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00180" index="180">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user looses its\ngrudge on the move\nlast used by the foe\nby cutting 4 PP from\nit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00181" index="181">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with\na chilling gust of\npowdery snow.\nIt may also freeze\nthe target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00182" index="182">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It enables the user\nto evade all attacks.\nIts chance of failing\nrises if it is used in\nsuccession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00183" index="183">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user throws a\npunch at blinding\nspeed.\nIt is certain to\nstrike first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00184" index="184">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user frightens\nthe foe with a scary\nface to sharply\nreduce its Speed\nstat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00185" index="185">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user draws up to\nthe foe disarmingly,\nthen throws a sucker\npunch.\nIt hits without fail.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00186" index="186">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user kisses the\nfoe with a sweet,\nangelic cuteness that\ncauses confusion.\n</language>
