	<row id="msg_0749_00190" index="190">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by\nspraying ink in the\nfoe’s face or eyes.\nIt may also lower the\ntarget’s accuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00191" index="191">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lays a trap\nof spikes at the\nfoe’s feet. The trap\nhurts foes that\nswitch into battle.</language>
