		<language name="English">The user attacks with\na gust of chilled air.\nIt also lowers the\ntarget’s Speed stat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00197" index="197">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It enables the user\nto evade all attacks.\nIts chance of failing\nrises if it is used in\nsuccession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00198" index="198">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user strikes at\nthe foe with a hard\nbone two to five\ntimes in a row.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00199" index="199">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user takes sure\naim at the foe.\nIt ensures the next\nattack does not fail\nto hit the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00200" index="200">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rampages\nand attacks for two\nto three turns.\nHowever, it then\nbecomes confused.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00201" index="201">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A five-turn sand-\nstorm is summoned\nto hurt all combatant\ntypes except Rock, \nGround, and Steel.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00202" index="202">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A nutrient-draining\nattack. The user’s\nHP is restored by\nhalf the damage taken\nby the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00203" index="203">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user endures any\nattack with at least\n1 HP. Its chance of\nfailing rises if it is\nused in succession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00204" index="204">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user charmingly\nstares at the foe,\nmaking it less wary.\nThe target’s Attack\nis sharply lowered.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00205" index="205">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user continually\nrolls into the foe\nover five turns. It\nbecomes stronger\neach time it hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00206" index="206">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A restrained attack\nthat prevents the\nfoe from fainting.\nThe target is left\nwith at least 1 HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00207" index="207">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user enrages the\nfoe into confusion.\nHowever, it also\nsharply raises the\nfoe’s Attack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00208" index="208">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user restores its\nown HP by up to half\nof its maximum HP.\nIt may also be used\nto heal an ally’s HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00209" index="209">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user throws an\nelectrically charged\ntackle at the foe.\nIt may also leave the\ntarget paralyzed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00210" index="210">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slashed\nwith scythes or\nclaws. Its power\nincreases if it hits\nin succession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00211" index="211">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit with\nwings of steel.\nIt may also raise the\nuser’s Defense stat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00212" index="212">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user affixes the\nfoe with a dark,\narresting look.\nThe target becomes\nunable to flee.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00213" index="213">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If it is the opposite\ngender of the user,\nthe foe becomes\ninfatuated and less\nlikely to attack.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00214" index="214">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">While it is asleep, the\nuser randomly uses\none of the moves it\nknows.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00215" index="215">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user makes a\nsoothing bell chime\nto heal the status\nproblems of all the\nparty Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00216" index="216">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A full-power attack\nthat grows more\npowerful the more\nthe user likes its\nTrainer.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00217" index="217">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by\ngiving the foe a\nbooby-trapped gift.\nIt restores HP\nsometimes, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00218" index="218">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A full-power attack\nthat grows more\npowerful the less\nthe user likes its\nTrainer.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00219" index="219">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates a\nprotective field that\nprevents status\nproblems for five\nturns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00220" index="220">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user adds its HP\nto the foe’s HP, then\nequally shares the\ncombined HP with the\nfoe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00221" index="221">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is razed with\na mystical fire of\ngreat intensity.\nIt may also leave the\ntarget with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00222" index="222">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user looses a\nground-shaking quake\naffecting everyone in\nbattle. Its power\nvaries.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00223" index="223">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is punched\nwith the user’s full,\nconcentrated power.\nIt confuses the foe\nif it hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00224" index="224">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Using its tough\nand impressive\nhorn, the user\nrams into the foe \nwith no letup.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00225" index="225">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user exhales\na mighty gust that\ninflicts damage.\nIt may also paralyze\nthe target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00226" index="226">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user switches\nplaces with a party\nPokémon in waiting,\npassing along any\nstat changes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00227" index="227">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user compels the\nfoe to keep using\nonly the move it last\nused for three to\nseven turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00228" index="228">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move that\ninflicts double damage\nif used on a foe that\nis switching out of\nbattle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00229" index="229">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A spin attack that\ncan also eliminate\nsuch moves as Bind,\nWrap, Leech Seed,\nand Spikes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00230" index="230">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A sweet scent that\nlowers the foe’s\nevasiveness. It also\nlures wild Pokémon\nif used in grass, etc.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00231" index="231">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slammed\nwith a steel-hard\ntail. It may also\nlower the target’s\nDefense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00232" index="232">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is raked\nwith steel claws.\nIt may also raise the\nuser’s Attack stat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00233" index="233">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user allows the\nfoe to attack first.\nIn return, this throw\nmove is guaranteed\nnot to miss.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00234" index="234">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user restores its\nown HP.\nThe amount of HP\nregained varies with\nthe weather.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00235" index="235">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user restores its\nown HP.\nThe amount of HP\nregained varies with\nthe weather.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00236" index="236">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user restores its\nown HP.\nThe amount of HP\nregained varies with\nthe weather.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00237" index="237">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A unique attack that\nvaries in type\ndepending on the\nPokémon using it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00238" index="238">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user delivers a\ndouble chop with its\nforearms crossed.\nIt has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00239" index="239">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user whips up a\nvicious tornado to\ntear at the foe.\nIt may also make the\nfoe flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00240" index="240">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user summons a\nheavy rain that falls\nfor five turns,\npowering up Water-\ntype moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00241" index="241">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user intensifies\nthe sun for five\nturns, powering up\nFire-type moves.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00242" index="242">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user crunches up\nthe foe with sharp\nfangs. It may also\nlower the target’s\nDefense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00243" index="243">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A retaliation move\nthat counters any\nspecial attack,\ninflicting double the\ndamage taken.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00244" index="244">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hypnotizes\nitself into copying\nany stat change\nmade by the foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00245" index="245">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user charges the\nfoe at blinding speed.\nThis attack always\ngoes before any\nother move.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00246" index="246">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with\na prehistoric power.\nIt may also raise all\nthe user’s stats at\nonce.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00247" index="247">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hurls a\nshadowy blob at the\nfoe. It may also\nlower the foe’s\nSp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00248" index="248">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Two turns after this\nmove is used, the foe\nis attacked with a\nhunk of psychic\nenergy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00249" index="249">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hits with a\npunch that may lower\nthe target’s Defense.\nIt can also smash\ncracked boulders.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00250" index="250">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Traps the foe inside a\nwhirlpool that lasts\nfor two to five turns.\nThe user can pass\nthrough whirlpools.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00251" index="251">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user gets all the\nparty Pokémon to\nattack the foe. The\nmore party Pokémon,\nthe more damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00252" index="252">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack that hits\nfirst and makes the\ntarget flinch. It only\nworks the first turn\nthe user is in battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00253" index="253">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks in\nan uproar for two to\nfive turns. Over that\ntime, no one can fall\nasleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00254" index="254">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user charges\nup power, and raises\nboth its Defense and\nSp. Def. The move can\nbe used three times.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00255" index="255">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The power stored\nusing the move\nStockpile is released\nat once in an attack.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00256" index="256">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The power stored\nusing the move\nStockpile is absorbed\nby the user to heal\nits HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00257" index="257">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user exhales a\nheated breath on the\nfoe to attack. It may\nalso leave the target\nwith a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00258" index="258">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user summons a\nhailstorm lasting five\nturns. It damages all\nPokémon except the\nIce type.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00259" index="259">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user torments\nand enrages the foe,\nmaking it incapable of\nusing the same move\ntwice in a row.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00260" index="260">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Flattery is used to\nconfuse the foe.\nHowever, it also\nraises the target’s\nSp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00261" index="261">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shoots a\nsinister, bluish white\nflame at the foe to\ninflict a burn.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00262" index="262">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user faints upon\nusing this move.\nIn return, it sharply\nlowers the target’s\nAttack and Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00263" index="263">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move that\ndoubles its power if\nthe user is poisoned,\nparalyzed, or has a\nburn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00264" index="264">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user focuses its\nmind before launching\na punch. It will fail\nif the user is hit\nbefore it is used.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00265" index="265">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This attack inflicts\ndouble damage on a\nparalyzed foe. It\nalso cures the foe’s\nparalysis, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00266" index="266">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user draws\nattention to itself,\nmaking all foes take\naim only at the user.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00267" index="267">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack that makes\nuse of nature’s\npower. Its effects\nvary depending on the\nuser’s environment.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00268" index="268">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user boosts the\npower of the Electric\nmove it uses next.\nIt also raises the\nuser’s Sp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00269" index="269">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is taunted\ninto a rage that\nallows it to use only\nattack moves for two\nto four turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00270" index="270">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A move that boosts\nthe power of the\nally’s attack in a\nDouble Battle.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00271" index="271">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user catches the\nfoe off guard and\nswaps the foe’s held\nitem with its own.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00272" index="272">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user mimics the\nfoe completely,\ncopying the foe’s\nnatural ability.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00273" index="273">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A self-healing move.\nThe user restores its\nown HP by up to half\nof its maximum HP\nin the next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00274" index="274">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hurriedly\nand randomly uses a\nmove among those\nknown by other\nPokémon in the party.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00275" index="275">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lays roots\nthat restore HP on\nevery turn.\nBecause it is rooted,\nit can’t switch out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00276" index="276">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the\nfoe with great power.\nHowever, it also\nlowers the user’s\nAttack and Defense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00277" index="277">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A barrier reflects\nback to the foe\nmoves like Leech\nSeed and moves\nthat damage status.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00278" index="278">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user recycles a\nheld item that\nhas been used in\nbattle so it can be\nused again.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00279" index="279">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move that\ninflicts double the\ndamage if the user\nhas been hurt by the\nfoe in the same turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00280" index="280">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with\ntough fists, etc. It\ncan also break any\nbarrier such as Light\nScreen and Reflect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00281" index="281">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lets loose a\nhuge yawn that lulls\nthe foe into falling\nasleep on the next\nturn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00282" index="282">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slaps down\nthe foe’s held item,\npreventing the item\nfrom being used\nduring the battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00283" index="283">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move that\ncuts down the foe’s\nHP to equal the\nuser’s HP.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00284" index="284">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks in\nan explosive fury.\nThe lower the user’s\nHP, the less powerful\nthis attack becomes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00285" index="285">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user employs its\npsychic power to\nexchange abilities\nwith the foe.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00286" index="286">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the foe knows any\nmove also known by\nthe user, the foe\nis prevented\nfrom using it.</language>
