	<row id="msg_0749_00287" index="287">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rests\nto cure itself of a\npoisoning, burn, or\nparalysis.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00288" index="288">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the user faints,\nthe user’s grudge\nfully depletes the PP\nof the foe’s move\nthat knocked it out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00289" index="289">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user steals the\neffects of any\nhealing or stat-\nchanging move the foe\nattempts to use.</language>
