	<row id="msg_0749_00290" index="290">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with\na secret power. Its\nadded effects vary\ndepending on the\nuser’s environment.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00291" index="291">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A two-turn attack.\nThe user dives\nunderwater on the\nfirst turn, then hits\non the next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00292" index="292">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user looses a\nflurry of open-palmed\narm thrusts that hit\ntwo to five times in a\nrow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00293" index="293">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user’s type is\nchanged depending on\nits environment, such\nas at water’s edge, in\ngrass, or in a cave.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00294" index="294">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stares at\nflashing lights to\nfocus its mind,\nsharply raising its\nSp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00295" index="295">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user looses a\ndamaging burst of\nlight. It may also\nreduce the target’s\nSp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00296" index="296">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A mistlike flurry of\ndown envelops and\ndamages the foe. It\nmay also lower the\ntarget’s Sp. Atk.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00297" index="297">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user covers the\nfoe with a mass of\ndown that sharply\nlowers the Attack\nstat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00298" index="298">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user performs a\nwobbly dance that\nconfuses all the\nPokémon in battle.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00299" index="299">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user launches a\nkick with a high\ncritical-hit ratio.\nIt may also leave the\ntarget with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00300" index="300">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user covers\nitself with mud. It\nweakens Electric-\ntype moves while the\nuser is in the battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00301" index="301">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user continually\nrolls into the foe\nover five turns. It\nbecomes stronger\neach time it hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00302" index="302">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by\nwildly swinging its\nthorny arms.\nIt may also make the\ntarget flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00303" index="303">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slacks off,\nrestoring its own HP\nby up to half of its\nmaximum HP.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00304" index="304">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lets loose\na horribly echoing\nshout with the\npower to inflict\ndamage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00305" index="305">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user bites the\nfoe with toxic fangs.\nIt may also leave the\nfoe badly poisoned.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00306" index="306">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slashes the\nfoe with hard and\nsharp claws.\nIt may also lower the\ntarget’s Defense.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00307" index="307">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is razed by\na fiery explosion.\nThe user must rest\non the next turn,\nhowever.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00308" index="308">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit with\na watery blast.\nThe user must rest\non the next turn,\nhowever.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00309" index="309">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is hit with a\nhard punch fired\nlike a meteor.\nIt may also raise\nthe user’s Attack.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00310" index="310">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the\nfoe while shouting in\na startling fashion.\nIt may also make the\ntarget flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00311" index="311">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack move that\nvaries in power and\ntype depending on\nthe weather.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00312" index="312">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user releases a\nsoothing scent that\nheals all status\nproblems affecting\nthe user’s party.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00313" index="313">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user feigns\ncrying to make the\nfoe feel flustered,\nsharply lowering its\nSp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00314" index="314">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user launches\nrazorlike wind to\nslash the foe.\nIt has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00315" index="315">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the\nfoe at full power.\nThe attack’s recoil\nsharply reduces the\nuser’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00316" index="316">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enables the user to\nhit a Ghost type with\nany type of move. It\nalso enables the user\nto hit an evasive foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00317" index="317">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Boulders are hurled\nat the foe. It also\nlowers the foe’s\nSpeed by preventing\nits movement.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00318" index="318">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith powdery scales\nblown by wind.\nIt may also raise all\nthe user’s stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00319" index="319">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A horrible sound like\nscraping metal is\nemitted to sharply\nreduce the foe’s\nSp. Def stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00320" index="320">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user plays a\npleasant melody that\nlulls the foe into a\ndeep sleep.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00321" index="321">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tickles the\nfoe into laughing,\nreducing its Attack\nand Defense stats.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00322" index="322">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user absorbs a\nmystical power from\nspace to raise its\nDefense and Sp. Def\nstats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00323" index="323">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user spouts\nwater to damage the\nfoe. The lower the\nuser’s HP, the less\npowerful it becomes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00324" index="324">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with\na sinister beam of\nlight. It may also\nconfuse the target.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00325" index="325">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user throws a\npunch at the foe from\nthe shadows.\nThe punch lands\nwithout fail.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00326" index="326">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with\nan odd, unseeable\npower.\nIt may also make the\nfoe flinch.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00327" index="327">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the\nfoe with an uppercut\nthrown skyward\nwith force.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00328" index="328">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user traps the\nfoe inside a harshly\nraging sandstorm for\ntwo to five turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00329" index="329">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is attacked\nwith a blast of\nabsolute-zero cold.\nThe foe instantly\nfaints if it hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00330" index="330">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by\nshooting out muddy\nwater.\nIt may also lower the\nfoe’s accuracy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00331" index="331">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user forcefully\nshoots seeds at the\nfoe. Two to five\nseeds are shot in\nrapid succession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00332" index="332">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user confounds\nthe foe with speed,\nthen slashes.\nThe attack lands\nwithout fail.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00333" index="333">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user launches\nsharp icicles at the\nfoe. It strikes two\nto five times in a\nrow.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00334" index="334">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hardens\nits body’s surface\nlike iron, sharply\nraising its Defense\nstat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00335" index="335">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user blocks the\nfoe’s way with arms\nspread wide to\nprevent escape.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00336" index="336">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user howls loudly\nto raise its spirit,\nboosting its Attack\nstat.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00337" index="337">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slashes the\nfoe with huge, sharp\nclaws.\n\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00338" index="338">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slammed\nwith an enormous\ntree.\nThe user can’t move\non the next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00339" index="339">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tenses its\nmuscles to bulk up\nits body, boosting\nboth its Attack and\nDefense stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00340" index="340">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user bounces up\nhigh, then drops on\nthe foe on the second\nturn. It may also\nparalyze the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00341" index="341">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by\nhurling a blob of mud\nat the foe.\nIt also reduces the\ntarget’s Speed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00342" index="342">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack with a\nhigh critical-hit\nratio. This tail \nattack may also \npoison the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00343" index="343">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user endearingly\napproaches the foe,\nthen steals the item\nthe foe is holding.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00344" index="344">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user electrifies\nitself, then charges\nat the foe. It causes\nconsiderable damage\nto the user as well.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00345" index="345">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user scatters\ncurious leaves that\nchase the foe.\nThis attack will not\nmiss.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00346" index="346">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user soaks itself\nwith water. The move\nweakens Fire-type\nmoves while the user\nis in the battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00347" index="347">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user quietly\nfocuses its mind and\ncalms its spirit to\nraise its Sp. Atk and\nSp. Def stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00348" index="348">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The foe is slashed\nwith a sharp leaf.\nIt has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00349" index="349">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user vigorously\nperforms a mystic,\npowerful dance that\nboosts its Attack and\nSpeed stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00350" index="350">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hurls hard\nrocks at the foe.\nTwo to five rocks are\nlaunched in quick\nsuccession.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00351" index="351">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user strikes the\nfoe with a quick jolt\nof electricity.\nThis attack cannot be\nevaded.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00352" index="352">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the\nfoe with a pulsing\nblast of water.\nIt may also confuse\nthe foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00353" index="353">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Two turns after this\nmove is used, the\nuser blasts the foe\nwith a concentrated\nbundle of light.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00354" index="354">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the\nfoe at full power.\nThe attack’s recoil\nsharply reduces the\nuser’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00355" index="355">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user lands and\nrests its body.\nIt restores the\nuser’s HP by up to\nhalf of its max HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00356" index="356">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Gravity is intensified\nfor five turns, making\nmoves involving flying\nunusable and\nnegating Levitation.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00357" index="357">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Enables the user to\nhit a Dark type with\nany type of move. It\nalso enables the user\nto hit an evasive foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00358" index="358">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This attack inflicts\nhigh damage on a\nsleeping foe. It\nalso wakes the foe\nup, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00359" index="359">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user swings and\nhits with its strong\nand heavy fist.\nIt lowers the user’s\nSpeed, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00360" index="360">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tackles the\nfoe with a high-speed\nspin. The slower the\nuser, the greater\nthe damage.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00361" index="361">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user faints. In\nreturn, the Pokémon\ntaking its place will\nhave its HP restored\nand status cured.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00362" index="362">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the foe’s HP is\ndown to about half,\nthis attack will hit\nwith double the\npower.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00363" index="363">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user draws power\nto attack by using\nits held Berry.\nThe Berry determines\nits type and power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00364" index="364">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An attack that hits a\nfoe using Protect or\nDetect. It also lifts\nthe effects of those\nmoves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00365" index="365">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user pecks the\nfoe. If the foe is\nholding a Berry, the\nuser plucks it and\ngains its effect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00366" index="366">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user whips up a\nturbulent whirlwind\nthat ups the Speed\nof all party Pokémon\nfor three turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00367" index="367">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user applies\npressure to stress\npoints, sharply\nboosting one of its\nstats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00368" index="368">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user retaliates\nagainst the foe that\nlast inflicted damage\non it with much\ngreater power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00369" index="369">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">After making its\nattack, the user\nrushes back to switch\nplaces with a party\nPokémon in waiting.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00370" index="370">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user fights the\nfoe up close without\nguarding itself. It\nalso cuts the user’s\nDefense and Sp. Def.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00371" index="371">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the user can use\nthis attack after the\nfoe attacks, its\npower is doubled.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00372" index="372">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the foe has\nalready taken some\ndamage in the same\nturn, this attack’s\npower is doubled.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00373" index="373">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It prevents the foe\nfrom using its held\nitem. Its Trainer is\nalso prevented from\nusing items on it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00374" index="374">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user flings its\nheld item at the foe\nto attack. Its power\nand effects depend\non the item.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00375" index="375">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Using its psychic\npower of suggestion,\nthe user transfers\nits status problems\nto the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00376" index="376">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The fewer PP this\nmove has, the more\npower it has for\nattack.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00377" index="377">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user prevents\nthe foe from using\nany HP-recovery\nmoves for five turns.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00378" index="378">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user powerfully\nwrings the foe.\nThe more HP the foe\nhas, the greater this\nattack’s power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00379" index="379">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user employs its\npsychic power to\nswitch its Attack\nwith its Defense\nstat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00380" index="380">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hurls up its\nstomach acids on\nthe foe. The fluid\neliminates the effect\nof the foe’s ability.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00381" index="381">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user chants an\nincantation toward\nthe sky, preventing\nthe foe from landing\ncritical hits.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00382" index="382">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tries to cut\nahead of the foe to\nsteal and use the\nfoe’s intended move\nwith greater power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00383" index="383">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user mimics the\nmove used immediately\nbefore it. The move\nfails if no other move\nhas been used yet.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00384" index="384">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user employs its\npsychic power to\nswitch changes to\nits Attack and\nSp. Atk with the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00385" index="385">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user employs its\npsychic power to\nswitch changes to\nits Defense and\nSp. Def with the foe.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00386" index="386">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This attack’s power\nincreases the more\nthe foe has powered\nup with stat changes.\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00387" index="387">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This move can be used\nonly after the user\nhas used all the\nother moves it knows\nin the battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00388" index="388">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A seed that causes\nworry is planted on\nthe foe. It prevents\nsleep by making its\nability Insomnia.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00389" index="389">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This move enables the\nuser to attack first.\nIt fails if the foe is\nnot readying an\nattack, however.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00390" index="390">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
