		<language name="English">An energy-draining\nshockwave. The user’s\nHP is restored by\nhalf the damage taken\nby those hit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00589" index="589">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user puts a\nforest curse on the\ntarget.\nThis adds Grass type\nto the target’s type.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00590" index="590">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Letting out a charming\ncry, the user does\nemotional damage to\nopposing Pokémon. This\nattack never misses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00591" index="591">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">With a parting threat,\nthe user lowers the\ntarget’s Attack and\nSp. Atk stats.\nThen it switches out.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00592" index="592">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">All stat changes\naffecting the target\nturn topsy-turvy and\nbecome the opposite of\nwhat they were.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00593" index="593">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">An energy-stealing\nkiss. The user’s\nHP is restored by\nhalf the damage taken\nby the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00594" index="594">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user protects\nitself and its allies\nfrom status moves\nwith a mysterious\npower.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00595" index="595">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user raises the\nDefense stats of all\nGrass-type Pokémon\nin battle with a\nmysterious power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00596" index="596">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user turns the\nground into Grassy\nTerrain for five\nturns. This powers up\nGrass-type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00597" index="597">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sets a Misty Terrain\nfor five turns. This\nprevents status\nailments and weakens\nDragon-Type moves.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00598" index="598">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If the target is\nelectrified, their\nmoves become Electric\ntype for the rest of\nthat turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00599" index="599">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by\nplaying rough with the\ntarget. This may also\nlower the target’s\nAttack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00600" index="600">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks\neverything around it\nwith the destructive\npower of a terrible\nexplosive sound.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00601" index="601">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">By locking down the\nbattlefield, the user\nkeeps all Pokémon\nfrom fleeing during\nthe next turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00602" index="602">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user protects\nitself from damage\nwhile lowering the\nAttack of any attacker\nthat makes contact.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00603" index="603">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user and the\ntarget become pals,\nlowering the target’s\nAttack stat.\nBypasses Protect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00604" index="604">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tells the\ntarget a secret,\nmaking it lose focus.\nThis lowers the\ntarget’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00605" index="605">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A storm of diamonds\nwhips opposing\nPokémon. This may also\nsharply boost the\nuser’s Defense stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00606" index="606">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user immerses the\ntarget in superheated\nsteam.\nThis may also leave\nthe target with a burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00607" index="607">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Using a hyperspace\nhole, the user strikes\nfrom far away. This\ncan hit a target using\nProtect or Detect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00608" index="608">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user hits the\ntarget with throwing\nstars two to five\ntimes. This move\nalways goes first.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00609" index="609">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user is protected\nfrom attacks, while\nalso damaging any\nattacker who makes\ndirect contact.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00610" index="610">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user boosts the\nSp. Def stat of an\nally Pokémon by using\na mysterious aroma.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00611" index="611">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user emits an\neerie impulse from its\nbody, harshly lowering\nthe target’s Sp. Atk\nstat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00612" index="612">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Foes are drenched in\na poisonous liquid.\nThis lowers the Attack,\nSp. Atk, and Speed of\na poisoned target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00613" index="613">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user covers the\ntarget in an explosive\npowder that damages\nthe target if they use\na Fire-type move.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00614" index="614">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user absorbs energy\nand sharply boosts its\nSp. Atk, Sp. Def, and\nSpeed stats on the next\nturn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00615" index="615">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Magnetic fields boost\nthe Defense and Sp. Def\nstats of ally Pokémon\nwith the Plus or Minus\nAbility.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00616" index="616">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Using Happy Hour\ndoubles the amount of\nprize money received\nafter battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00617" index="617">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">For five turns, Pokémon\non the ground have\npowered up Electric-type\nmoves and can no longer\nfall asleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00618" index="618">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
