	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00619" index="619">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user and an ally\nhold hands.\nThis makes them very\nhappy.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00620" index="620">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user stares at\nthe target with its\nbaby-eyes, lowering\nits Attack stat.\nAlways goes first.</language>
	</row>
