		<language name="English">The user performs a\nperfectly timed triple\ndive, hitting the target\nwith splashes of water\nthree times in a row.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00874" index="874">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A spin attack that can\neliminate such moves as\nBind, Wrap and Leech\nSeed. It also poisons\nopposing Pokémon.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00875" index="875">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target’s essence is\ncaptured in a sketch.\nThis makes the Abilities\nof the user and its ally\nmatch the target’s.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00876" index="876">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user sharply\nboosts its Attack,\nSp. Atk, and Speed\nstats by using its\nown HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00877" index="877">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user slashes at the\ntarget after kowtowing\nto make the target let\ndown its guard. This\nattack never misses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00878" index="878">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user throws a rigged\nbouquet of flowers at\nthe target. This attack\nnever misses and always\nlands a critical hit.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00879" index="879">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user blows out\nraging flames as if\nsinging, scorching the\ntarget. This also boosts\nthe user’s Sp. Atk stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00880" index="880">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user toys with the\ntarget and attacks using\nlight and fluid dance\nsteps. This also boosts\nthe user’s Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00881" index="881">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user performs a\ntackle like a raging\nbull. It can also break\nbarriers, such as Light\nScreen and Reflect.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00882" index="882">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user throws out a\nmass of coins. This also\nlowers the user’s Sp.\nAtk stat. Money is\nearned after the battle.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00883" index="883">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rends with an\nethereal blade. Its\npower is boosted by 50\npercent if the user is\non Electric Terrain.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00884" index="884">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user blasts out\nboiling-hot water. Its\npower is not lowered in\nharsh sunlight but\nrather boosted by 50%.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00885" index="885">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user summons a\nruinous disaster.\nThis cuts the\ntarget’s HP in half.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00886" index="886">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user causes a\nmassive prehistoric\nexplosion. This move’s\npower is boosted more if\nit’s super effective.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00887" index="887">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user pierces its\ntarget with futuristic\nelectricity. This move’s\npower is boosted more if\nit’s supereffective.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00888" index="888">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user creates\na decoy using its own\nHP, then swaps places\nwith a party Pokémon\nin waiting.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00889" index="889">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tells a\nchillingly bad joke\nbefore switching out.\nThis summons a snowstorm\nlasting five turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00890" index="890">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user tidies up and\nremoves entry hazards\nand Substitutes. This\nalso boosts the user’s\nAttack and Speed stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00891" index="891">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user summons a\nsnowstorm lasting five\nturns. This boosts the\nDefense stats of Ice\ntypes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00892" index="892">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by\npouncing on the\ntarget.\nThis also lowers the\ntarget’s Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00893" index="893">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks as if\nleaping out from tall\ngrass. The user’s\nnimble footwork raises\nits Speed stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00894" index="894">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks the\ntarget by showering it\nwith cold water. This\nalso lowers the target’s\nAttack stat.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00895" index="895">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shoots its own\narmor out as blazing\nprojectiles. It also\ncuts the user’s Defense\nand Sp. Def stats.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00896" index="896">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user focuses its\nbitter feelings into a\nslash. The user’s HP\nis restored by up to\nhalf the damage taken.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00897" index="897">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user discharges\nall the electricity\nfrom its body. After\nthis, the user loses\nthe Electric type.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00898" index="898">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user swings its\nwhole body around to\nattack with its huge\nhammer. This move can’t\nbe used twice in a row.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00899" index="899">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user retaliates\nagainst the foe that\nlast inflicted damage\non it with much\ngreater power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00900" index="900">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user expels\npressurized water to\ncut at the target like\na blade. It has a high\ncritical-hit ratio.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00901" index="901">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rams into the\ntarget with blazing\nenergy. This may also\nleave the target with\na burn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00902" index="902">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rams into the\ntarget with malicious\nintent. This may put\nthe target to sleep.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00903" index="903">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rams into the\ntarget with a\npoisonous end. This\nmay also poison the\ntarget.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00904" index="904">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rams into the\ntarget with great\nforce. This may also\nleave the target with\nparalysis.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00905" index="905">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user rams into the\ntarget with a fae-like\nforce. This may also\nconfuse the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00906" index="906">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user unleashes the\nfull brunt of its spirit\nfrom a full moon.\nThis move can’t be used\ntwice in a row.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00907" index="907">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user fires a blast\nof tea, restoring HP\nby up to half the\ndamage dealt. This may\nalso burn the target.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00908" index="908">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user sets off a\ngooey explosion, which\ncauses the target’s\nSpeed stat to drop each\nturn for three turns.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00909" index="909">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user strikes with a\ncudgel. It has a high\ncritical hit chance, and\nits type changes with\nthe user’s mask.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00910" index="910">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A two-turn attack.\nThe user gathers\nlight, then fires a\nhigh voltage shot\non the second turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00911" index="911">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user bombards the\ntarget with crystalline\npower. When used by\nStellar Terapagos, this\nmove damages all foes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00912" index="912">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user shoots a beam\nof light. Sometimes\nthe user’s heads shoot\nin unison, doubling\nthe move’s power.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00913" index="913">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user’s intensely hot\nfur protects it from\nattacks and also burns\nany attacker that makes\ndirect contact with it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00914" index="914">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks first\nwith a jolt of\nelectricity. This move\nfails if the target is\nnot readying an attack.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00915" index="915">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Light from atop the\nuser’s head cleaves the\ntarget. This move hits\neven if the target\nprotects itself.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00916" index="916">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks by\nlaunching particle\nblades at the target\ntwice in a row. This\nattack never misses.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00917" index="917">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The target is crushed by\nthe user. The more HP\nthe target has left, the\ngreater the move’s\npower.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00918" index="918">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks using\nits angelic voice. This\nalso confuses the target\nif its stats have been\nboosted during the turn.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00919" index="919">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user desperately\nattacks the target. This\nmove’s power is doubled\nif the user’s previous\nmove failed.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00920" index="920">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user electrifies its\nbody and drops onto the\ntarget. If this move\nmisses, the user takes\ndamage instead.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00921" index="921">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user attacks with\nunpleasant sound waves.\nFor two turns, the\ntarget is prevented\nfrom recovering HP.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00922" index="922">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user strikes\nreactively, making the\ntarget flinch. This move\nfails if the target is\nnot readying a priority\rmove.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0749_00923" index="923">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The user pours toxins\ninto the target through\na corrosive chain. This\nmay also leave the\ntarget badly poisoned.</language>
	</row>
</body>
